WEBVTT - Homeo Healthcare Headache Education (30s)

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.400
A familiar mild headache can sometimes be linked with everyday lifestyle factors.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.700
Screen focus, neck posture, sleep changes, and hydration can all contribute.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:17.500
Hydrating, taking screen breaks, and noting your daily patterns bring clarity.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.800
A sudden severe headache, weakness, confusion, fever with stiff neck, or after injury needs urgent care.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.800
Mindful daily awareness. Trusted medical guidance.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
www.homeo.healthcare/knowledge/symptoms/headache
